    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1924 the U.S. bought the 208‑acre Summerfields estate to build the Castle Point Veterans Hospital, the first VA TB hospital west of the Hudson.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        24,
        25,
        26,
